div.p:
(Thrusts 
                     Galatea
                       from her.)

Fred.  Edward, I sincerely hope you may live to apologize for this. (Offers to shake hands; 
Ted
  refuses.)

—Grounds of Castle Adamant; Waterfall and Stream, crossed by rustic bridge; 
                     Girl-Students
                       discovered grouped about the stage, occupied with philosophical instruments, &c.
